  "title": {
   "en": "Informa"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "ja": "インフォーマ　－INFORMA－"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "In an age when anyone can easily transmit information Kanji Mishima works as a reporter for a weekly magazine. He joined the company with the belief that he wanted to convey justice... but now he is on the verge of being fired. Then, Mishima came across an opportunity, a last chance to turn things around as a reporter... It was a chance to meet the \"Informer,\" an urban legendary informant who is well versed in everything from politics to entertainment and the underworld. The most powerful card that connects him to \"Informer,\" an urban legendary informant who is well versed in politics, entertainment, and the underworld.\n\nBet your life!",
   "ja": "誰もが簡単に情報を発信できる時代に週刊誌の記者として働く・三島寛治｢正義を伝えたい｣ と、信念を掲げ入社したはずが…今じゃクビ目前そんな三島に訪れた、記者として一発逆転する最後のチャンス…それは、政治、芸能、裏社会、全ての情報に精通するという都市伝説の情報屋｢インフォーマ｣と繋がる最強のカード\n\n人生を賭けろ！"
  },
